option.TAA=TAA §e[?]
option.TAA.comment=Temporal smoothing with history blending (Catmull–Rom). Reduces grain/aliasing over time. Can leave trails on fast camera motion; works best at higher screen resolutions. Edge AA is FXAA
option.TAA_STRENGTH=TAA strength §e[?]
option.TAA_STRENGTH.comment=0 = off. How strongly past frames are blended. Higher = smoother image with less grain, but more trail/ghosting
option.FXAA=FXAA §e[?]
option.FXAA.comment=Edge anti-aliasing. Cheap, no world shake, no trail. This is the main AA
option.SHARPEN_STRENGTH=Sharpen §e[?]
option.SHARPEN_STRENGTH.comment=Restores bite after FXAA. 0 is off. ~0.3 default
option.SUNSET_INTENSITY=Sunset / sunrise intensity §e[?]
option.SUNSET_INTENSITY.comment=Strength of the orange and pink horizon glow at dawn and dusk
option.STYLE_EXPOSURE=Overall brightness §e[?]
option.STYLE_EXPOSURE.comment=Lower values make the image gloomier. Highlights stay a bit brighter than the rest
option.STYLE_SATURATION=Saturation
option.STYLE_CONTRAST=Contrast
option.OVERWORLD_FOG_MAX_SLIDER=Overworld transition fog §e[?]
option.OVERWORLD_FOG_MAX_SLIDER.comment=Fog intensity during sunsets and sunrises
option.OVERWORLD_FOG_MIN_SLIDER=Overworld fog
option.END_STARS_SPEED=End stars speed §e[?]
option.END_STARS_SPEED.comment=Fall passes per loop, rounded to a whole number so u=0 and u=1 match. 0.05 × 20 s = 1 pass
option.END_STARS_PERIOD=End stars loop period §e[?]
option.END_STARS_PERIOD.comment=Seconds until falling stars repeat identically, frame for frame
option.END_STARS_PHASE=End stars phase §e[?]
option.END_STARS_PHASE.comment=Loop offset. 0 = start of the clock, 0.5 = halfway through the cycle
option.END_STARS_AMOUNT=End stars amount
option.END_STARS_OPACITY=End stars opacity
option.END_STARS_OPACITY.comment=How visible the End stars are over the sky.
option.END_FOG=End haze §e[?]
option.END_FOG.comment=Soft purple distance haze so the End feels less dry. Matches Distant Horizons LODs
option.END_FOG_STRENGTH=Haze strength
option.END_FOG_STRENGTH.comment=Overall End haze amount
option.END_FOG_DENSITY=Haze density §e[?]
option.END_FOG_DENSITY.comment=How quickly distance sinks into violet murk
option.END_FOG_SAMPLES=Haze samples
option.END_FOG_SAMPLES.comment=More steps = softer layers.
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE=Auto exposure
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment=Based on light where you stand (eyeBrightness), not where you look. Torches/sun lower EV; caves raise it
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_STRENGTH=Auto exposure strength
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_SPEED=Auto exposure speed §e[?]
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE_SPEED.comment=How fast exposure adapts when you move between dark and bright places
option.VL=God rays / light shafts
option.VL.comment=Look toward the sun through leaves/windows. Needs shadows on. Open sun is suppressed; shafts through canopy stay. ~0.3 usually looks good
option.VL_STRENGTH=God ray strength
option.VL_SAMPLES=God ray samples
option.VL_SAMPLES.comment=More samples = cleaner shafts. Grain is often dither/leaf shadows, not just sample count; 12–16 is usually enough

