option.HIGHLIGHT_WAXED.comment=Holding a honeycomb highlights waxed blocks
option.GLOWING_ORES=Glowing ores
option.NETHER_COLOR_GRADING=Nether color grading §e[?]
option.NETHER_COLOR_GRADING.comment=Slight warmth and a highlight shoulder so lava stays orange instead of white
option.NETHER_AMBIENT=Nether brightness §e[?]
option.NETHER_AMBIENT.comment=Fills the cavern a little. 0.95 default — Photon-like, slightly dim. Raise if it feels too dark
option.NETHER_FOG=Nether haze §e[?]
option.NETHER_FOG.comment=Photon-like: thick dark murk. Distance sinks into crimson shadow; lava stays the bright accent. Not a glowing orange sky
option.NETHER_FOG_STRENGTH=Haze strength
option.NETHER_FOG_DENSITY=Haze density §e[?]
option.NETHER_FOG_DENSITY.comment=How fast the cavern goes dark. 1.15 default. Higher = heavier smoke
option.NETHER_FOG_GLOW=Lava glow in haze §e[?]
option.NETHER_FOG_GLOW.comment=Warm underlight only near lava seas. Keep low so the air stays dark
option.NETHER_BLOOM=Lava bloom §e[?]
option.NETHER_BLOOM.comment=Tight glow on lava/fire. Low by default so bloom does not fill the cavern
option.NETHER_FOG_SAMPLES=Haze samples
option.NETHER_FOG_SAMPLES.comment=More steps = smoother layers. 12 is usually enough
option.NETHER_FOG_EMBERS=Ash clouds §e[?]
option.NETHER_FOG_EMBERS.comment=Large slow ash patches in the haze. Off by default — can look grainy without TAA
